{"asyativaktiKyatiByaH aN": [{"id": "asyativaktiKyAtiByaH aN", "headword": "अस्यतिवक्तिख्यातिभ्यः अङ्", "headword_slp1": "asyativaktiKyAtiByaH aN", "fold": "asyativaktiKyatiByaH aN", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "ashtadhyayi-english", "senses": [{"gloss": "After the verbs अस् 'to throw', वच् 'to speak' and ख्या 'to speak', अङ् is the substitute of च्लि , when लुङ् (Aorist) follows signifying an agent.\n\nTerms: च्लि", "gloss_language": "en"}], "synonyms": ["अस्यतिवक्तिख्यातिभ्यः अङ् ३.१.५२", "३.१.५२", "३.१.५२ अस्यतिवक्तिख्यातिभ्यः अङ्"], "synonyms_slp1": ["asyativaktiKyAtiByaH aN ३.१.५२", "३.१.५२", "३.१.५२ asyativaktiKyAtiByaH aN"]}], "asyatitfsoH kriyantare kalesu": [{"id": "asyatitfzoH kriyA'ntare kAlezu", "headword": "अस्यतितृषोः क्रियाऽन्तरे कालेषु", "headword_slp1": "asyatitfzoH kriyA'ntare kAlezu", "fold": "asyatitfsoH kriyantare kalesu", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "ashtadhyayi-english", "senses": [{"gloss": "The affix णमुल् comes after the verbs 1. अस् 'to throw' 2. तृष् 'to be thirsty' when it is intended to express an intermission of the action denoted by the root, provided that a word in the Accusative -2nd case denoting time is in composition.\n\nTerms: णमुल्", "gloss_language": "en"}], "synonyms": ["अस्यतितृषोः क्रियाऽन्तरे कालेषु ३.४.५७", "३.४.५७", "३.४.५७ अस्यतितृषोः क्रियाऽन्तरे कालेषु"], "synonyms_slp1": ["asyatitfzoH kriyA'ntare kAlezu ३.४.५७", "३.४.५७", "३.४.५७ asyatitfzoH kriyA'ntare kAlezu"]}], "asyatesTuk": [{"id": "asyatesTuk", "headword": "अस्यतेस्थुक्", "headword_slp1": "asyatesTuk", "fold": "asyatesTuk", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "ashtadhyayi-english", "senses": [{"gloss": "The अङ्ग (stem) अस्'to be' (अस्यते) gets the augment थुक् before this Aorist अङ्।\n\nTerms: Shortening", "gloss_language": "en"}], "synonyms": ["अस्यतेस्थुक् ७.४.१७", "७.४.१७", "७.४.१७ अस्यतेस्थुक्"], "synonyms_slp1": ["asyatesTuk ७.४.१७", "७.४.१७", "७.४.१७ asyatesTuk"]}], "asya cvO": [{"id": "asya cvO", "headword": "अस्य च्वौ", "headword_slp1": "asya cvO", "fold": "asya cvO", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "ashtadhyayi-english", "senses": [{"gloss": "Long ई is substituted for the final of अ or आ of a Nominal stem, before the Adverbial affix च्वि -- अभूततद्भावे कृभ्वस्तियोगे सम्पद्यकर्तरि च्विः ५.४.५०।\n\nTerms: Long ई", "gloss_language": "en"}], "synonyms": ["अस्य च्वौ ७.४.३२", "७.४.३२", "७.४.३२ अस्य च्वौ"], "synonyms_slp1": ["asya cvO ७.४.३२", "७.४.३२", "७.४.३२ asya cvO"]}]}